=========================================
Frontend-Backend Integration Test
=========================================

Test 1: Backend Health Check
Command: curl http://localhost:8080/barcodes/health
Response: Backend is running!
✓ Backend health check PASSED

Test 2: Get All Barcodes (should be empty initially)
Command: curl http://localhost:8080/barcodes
Response: []
✓ Empty list retrieved successfully

Test 3: Add First Barcode
Command: curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/barcodes -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"name":"Loyalty Card","data":"123456789"}'
Response: {"name":"Loyalty Card","data":"123456789"}
✓ First barcode added successfully

Test 4: Add Second Barcode
Command: curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/barcodes -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"name":"Gym Membership","data":"987654321"}'
Response: {"name":"Gym Membership","data":"987654321"}
✓ Second barcode added successfully

Test 5: Get All Barcodes (should have 2 items)
Command: curl http://localhost:8080/barcodes
Response: [{"name":"Loyalty Card","data":"123456789"},{"name":"Gym Membership","data":"987654321"}]
✓ Both barcodes retrieved successfully

Test 6: Delete First Barcode
Command: curl -X DELETE http://localhost:8080/barcodes/Loyalty%20Card
Response: (no content expected)
Remaining barcodes: [{"name":"Gym Membership","data":"987654321"}]
✓ First barcode deleted successfully

Test 7: Delete Second Barcode
Command: curl -X DELETE http://localhost:8080/barcodes/Gym%20Membership
Response: (no content expected)
Final state: []
✓ All barcodes deleted, list is empty

=========================================
Integration Test Complete
=========================================

All backend API endpoints tested successfully!
The frontend should now be able to:
  - Load barcodes from the backend
  - Add new barcodes via POST requests
  - Delete barcodes via DELETE requests
